title: to really pressure-cook the beans
pid: a5e23473-7f5f-4178-b4bf-89fa8158f5f5
body: |2-
  I tried a third hot soak because the second hadn't loosened the skins.
  After the pressure valve started gurgling,
  it took maybe another 25 minutes for it to really get going.
  Once that happened I reduced heat to 3 and let it go 20 minutes.
